  routeNotes: Reference 2.2.1map.png / 2.2.2map.jpg + oral route. Yellow -> green
    1 solo -> push blue 1 off upper shelf -> green 1 carry -> white 1 across white
    2's filled gap -> white right ledge -> move white 3 out from below flag to green
    2 -> blue 3 -> flag. Crown height calibrated so box 2 top fills the 1.08-wide
    white-road gap after strict mirror. Upper barrier is box-only. Flag lower face
    leaves 0.17 above a standing player on initial box 3; move box out before final
    jump.
